Repo root: /home/muk/projects/siminfeng/campaign. Engine tree: ref/llama.cpp-up1108 @ cf34d311 (do NOT modify it; work in a copy, e.g. `git -C ref/llama.cpp-up1108 worktree add /tmp/j-om8-src cf34d311` or cp -a, then apply patches there).
