185:- C2 NVMe ceiling (fio, D031): drive is 570 MiB/s class; 4 KiB qd1 19.6 MiB/s; PCIe Gen3 x4; one drive, read-only.
186:- C3 first-order model (D031): decode_tps ~ disk_BW / (615 MB x miss_rate); at 570 MiB/s and miss 1.0 -> ~1.0 t/s; measured 1.27-1.36 implies miss ~0.70-0.75. One model, a fit not a validation.
188:- C5 upstream moe-cache hit rates (D030/D032): 37.7% at 512 MiB, 54.7% (1024 + cpu-share 0.5), 64.0% at 2048 MiB. Hit rate counters are valid; the associated speeds in upv are contaminated.
